# Tool scratch — regenerated on demand, no reason to keep history of it.
.playwright-mcp/

# Obsidian plugin cache — derived data, rebuilds itself.
.smart-env/

# Syncthing's folder marker. Empty, and Syncthing is being dropped.
.stfolder/

# Deliberately NOT ignored, despite looking like junk:
#   .obsidian/     app config — Obsidian is dropped, but config is cheap to keep
#   .stversions/   Syncthing's old file versions. Once Syncthing goes these are
#                  orphaned, and they may hold the only copy of an old note.
#                  The standing rule is never delete; so they are tracked.
#   .trash/        same reasoning.
